Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:47.10,0:13:49.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}有人在吗？我是碇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:52.10,0:13:53.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}绫波，我进来了
