Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:47.40,0:14:48.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不…那个…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:52.00,0:14:53.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我不是故意的…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:29.95,0:15:31.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可以让开吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:35.70,0:15:37.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}啊…那个…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:55.10,0:15:56.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}什么事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:57.00,0:15:59.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不…我…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:04.60,0:16:08.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是有人拜…拜托我…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:08.40,0:16:10.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}就是那个…什么来着…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:10.80,0:16:16.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}卡…卡片换新的了…人家叫我送来…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:18.20,0:16:22.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以…所以…我并没有那个意思…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:28.80,0:16:32.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}律子小姐说忘了交给你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:33.00,0:16:36.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是真的…然后我按电铃也没人回应…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:36.10,0:16:38.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}门也没锁…所以…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:58.20,0:17:01.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}中央教条（Central Dogma） 现正开放
